dence: statuses list generic quest statuses. FINDING SCOPE. correction \"任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\".\n\nQ012 reconsider: \"Open profile(in browser)\" → \"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\". \"profile\" → \"用户信息\" — but \"Show infos\" also = 用户信息 likely, though its translation isn't visible. Not disprovable. \"我的\" addition harmless. Skip.\n\nNow Q004: is \"七章\" contradicted? Context desc: \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" and 8 knownLore checks. Yes FINDING. Target span \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\". Correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\". Evidence: \"desc = _t[[Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.]]\".\n\nQ010 evidence: \"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.\" and \"config.settings.hide_gestures\". Use \"a color coded trail is displayed\" to support 显示.\n\nQ016 evidence: \"Dialog.init(self, _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", 1, 1)\" — hmm, that just shows title usage. Better evidence: the file context \"local Faction = require \\\"engine.Faction\\\"\" and GetQuantity — the dialog alters faction. The function name \"Alter Faction\". Evidence must appear verbatim in source_context. Use \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"? That's the source itself... evidence must be from source or source_context. I can use \"local Faction = require \\\"engine.Faction\\\"\" plus maybe \"self:use(item)\" — use(item) changes faction presumably. Let me just cite \"Alter Faction\" from source — evidence field must be verbatim from source or context. \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\" is the source. Fine, evidence can be from source. Actually claim: Alter → 锁定 (lock) wrong; should be 更改/改变. Evidence: \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\".\n\nQ011: also check \"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\" → \"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\" fine. \"He leans toward you. Your mind is suddenly filled with feelings of peace and happiness.\" → \"*他靠向你，你的脑海里突然充满了平静和幸福。*\" fine.\n\nQ011 correction: \"这就是维网。\" Hmm \"the Way\" — maybe better \"这就是‘维网’。\" Keep \"这就是维网。\" evidence \"This is the Way.\"\n\nQ013 correction: \"你看不懂的文字：\" — but keeping full span: correction could be \"你看不懂的文字：\". target_span: \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\". Evidence verbatim: \"(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'And AMAKTHEL made the SHER'TUL\" — need verbatim substring from context. Yes that string appears.\n\nQ017 evidence: \"or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world\" — the translation branch. Or use \"not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\")\". I'll use \"(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world\" — verbatim appears.\n\nQ019 evidence: \"and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end}\" — verbatim: \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\". Target span: \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" — must be verbatim in target: yes. Correction: \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\" claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ014 target_span \"达到白银捐赠等级\". Evidence: \"name = \\\"Silver Donator\\\", id = \\\"SILVER_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated at least 6 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]]\" — verbatim substring: \"name = \\\"Silver Donator\\\"\" appears. Correction: \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元。\" claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ020 target_span \"八章\". Evidence: \"desc = _t[[Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.]]\" verbatim appears. Correction: \"加库尔的传说\". claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ004 claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ006 claim_type SCOPE. target_span \"主线任务\". Evidence: \"[Quest.FAILED] = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"\" — verbatim appears? In context: \"[Quest.FAILED] = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\",\" yes. Correction \"任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\".\n\nQ010 claim_type DIRECTION. target_span \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\". Evidence: \"a color coded trail is displayed\". Correction \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\".\n\nQ011 claim_type DIRECTION (negation). target_span \"这不是维网\". Evidence \"This is the Way.\" Correction \"这就是维网。\"\n\nQ016 claim_type ACTION. target_span \"锁定阵营\". Correction \"更改阵营\". Evidence \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\".\n\nQ013 claim_type ADDITION. target_span \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\". Correction \"你看不懂的文字：\".\n\nQ017 claim_type ADDITION. target_span \"你永远无法理解的文字\". Correction \"你无法理解的文字\".\n\nQ019 claim_type ADDITION. target_span \"即使我不会提取宝石，\". Actually span must be verbatim in target: \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以\" — I'll use \"即使我不会提取宝石\". Is \"即使我不会提取宝石\" verbatim? Target: \"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让...\" yes substring \"即使我不会提取宝石\" present.\n\nQ014: target \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\" span \"达到白银捐赠等级\" present.\n\nItems with empty candidates: Q001, Q002, Q003, Q005, Q007, Q008, Q009, Q012, Q015, Q018. That's 10 empty, 10 with findings. Observations required (minLength 1) for all.\n\nLet me double check Q015: \"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\" → \"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\" fine. Q018 fine.\n\nQ007: \"You must wear this object to use it!\" — target \"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\" — wear → 装备 fine.\n\nQ001: \"after letting her grow as powerful as possible\" — \"让她成长到尽可能强大之后\" would be more precise; target \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她\" omits \"letting\" (agency) but \"让\" implied. Fine, empty.\n\nQ005 reconsider once more: \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" — reading ≠ learned but in game context reading lore = learning it. Also \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" → \"有关魔法大爆炸的...文献\" — \"Chronicles\" dropped, \"8章文献\" retains. Acceptable. Empty.\n\nQ009 — empty. Q012 — empty.\n\nWrite JSON.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q001\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"目标与源文语义一致，'成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她'忠实传达了原文的时序与条件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q002\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"人名、地名与讥讽语句均与源文相容，德斯镇/最后希望城酒馆招牌的方向关系正确，未见可由可见证据支持的实质性缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q003\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"目标完整传达了斗篷隐藏真实身份、旁人只看到普通人类以及哀求的语气，与源文一致。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q004\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"七章\",\n          \"correction\": \"魔法大爆炸的故事\",\n          \"evidence\": \"desc = _t[[Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.]]\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文 'Tales of the Spellblaze' 不含章节数；上下文中该成就描述明确为八章（且 can_gain 校验 8 个 spellblaze-chronicles 条目），目标中的'七章'为与可见证据相抵触的新增信息。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q005\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'阅读了……8章文献'与'Learned the eight chapters'在游戏语境下语义相容，数字一致，未见客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q006\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"SCOPE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"主线任务\",\n          \"correction\": \"任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\",\n          \"evidence\": \"[Quest.FAILED] = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该状态文本为通用任务对话框中所有任务共用的失败提示（上下文同时列出 New/Updated/Completed/Done 等通用状态），源文仅说 'Quest'，目标擅自限定为'主线任务'，缩小了适用范围。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q007\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'你必须装备这件物品才能使用它'与源文'You must wear this object to use it'语义一致。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q008\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'流浪者随机种子'对应 wanderer seed，分享后使用同一套技能组合的说明与源文相容，未见客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q009\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"目标以陈述句改写祈使句 'Spare me the small talk'，但拒绝寒暄、直奔阻止对方的交际意图与源文一致，不构成可由可见证据确定的缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q010\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"隐藏鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"correction\": \"显示鼠标手势轨迹\",\n          \"evidence\": \"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文 'Display mouse gesture trails' 为显示轨迹；上下文描述也说明做手势时会显示带颜色的轨迹，且对应开关为 hide_gestures。目标译成'隐藏'，方向完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q011\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"这不是维网\",\n          \"correction\": \"这就是维网。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"This is the Way.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文为肯定句 'This is the Way.'，目标加入否定词'不'，含义完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q012\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'（在浏览器里打开）'对应 '(in browser)'，'打开用户信息'可对应打开个人资料页，未见可由可见证据判定的实质性缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q013\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你看不懂的文字：\",\n          \"evidence\": \"(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'And AMAKTHEL made the SHER'TUL\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文仅为 'which you do not understand'；目标新增'即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解'，而上下文代码结构显示当玩家具备 speaks_shertul 属性时会给出对应的译文分支，即懂夏·图尔语便能理解，新增内容与可见证据相抵触。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q014\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"达到白银捐赠等级\",\n          \"correction\": \"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"name = \\\"Silver Donator\\\", id = \\\"SILVER_DONATOR\\\"\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该条目为 GOLD_DONATOR 成就的描述（至少16欧元），而'白银捐赠等级'在上下文中是独立的 Silver Donator 成就（至少6欧元），目标新增的等级归属与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q015\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号'忠实对应 'Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena'。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q016\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ACTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"锁定阵营\",\n          \"correction\": \"更改阵营\",\n          \"evidence\": \"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文 'Alter Faction' 意为更改/变更阵营，目标译作'锁定阵营'，动作性质不同，属于实质性误译。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q017\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"你永远无法理解的文字\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解的文字：\",\n          \"evidence\": \"(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文 'which you do not understand' 仅陈述当前看不懂；目标新增'永远'表示永远无法理解，而上下文显示当玩家懂得夏·图尔语时会提供对应译文分支，'永远'与可见证据相抵触。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q018\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"'角色达到50级'忠实对应 'Got a character to level 50.'。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q019\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使我不会提取宝石\",\n          \"correction\": \"可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS)\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文仅询问转化之盒能否自动提取宝石；目标新增'即使我不会提取宝石'，而该选项在上下文中的显示条件恰恰要求玩家已掌握提取宝石天赋（knowTalent(T_EXTRACT_GEMS)），新增前提与可见证据直接矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q020\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"八章\",\n          \"correction\": \"加库尔的传说\",\n          \"evidence\": \"desc = _t[[Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.]]\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文 'The Legend of Garkul' 不含章节数；上下文中该成就描述明确为五章（且 can_gain 校验 5 个 garkul-history 条目），目标中的'八章'为与可见证据相矛盾的新增信息。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10688,"output":7331,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":5286,"totalTokens":18019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984617224,"responseId":"202608291423388ce8415a00564799","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-b-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q001\",\"source\":\"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\",\"target\":\"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Disturbed an old battlefield and survived the consequences.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"The Rat Lich\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_RATLICH\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed the terrible Rat Lich.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Shasshhiy'Kaish\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_CULTISTS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Bringer of Doom\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_PEDESTALS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed a Bringer of Doom.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"A living one!\\\", id = \\\"CALDIZAR\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Was teleported into Caldizar's Fortress, far into the void between the stars.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q002\",\"source\":\"#{bold}#Gorran, Cornac Archer#{normal}#\\nThat snake. That addlepated beardling. That coin-hounding, blackhearted, stump-kneed dwarf! A scout he calls himself! The finest eyes of the Iron Throne, able to read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth! Surely someone with such grandiose praise for his own eyesight would have spotted that cold drake waiting in ambush for us! Damnable thing, I'll be lucky if I can ever use my left arm again. I can't use my bow now ... I'm effectively dead wood to the team. I'm beginning to think that Sodelost has ulterior motives... I wouldn't put it past a dwarf to lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets! I keep telling Relle, but she won't listen. The fool...\",\"target\":\"#{bold}#科纳克人弓箭手，高岚#{normal}#\\n那个毒蛇。那个没脑子的毛脸小子。那个追着钱跑、心肠漆黑、短腿跛脚的矮人！还自称斥候！还说自己是钢铁王座眼力最好的家伙，坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌！如此夸耀自己视力的人，理应发现那条等着伏击我们的寒冰飞龙才对！该死的东西，我这辈子还能用左臂就算走运了。现在我拉不了弓……对队伍而言简直成了废物。我开始怀疑苏达罗斯特另有所图……矮人为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死，也不是做不出来！我一再提醒瑞丽，她却听不进去。这个蠢货……\",\"source_context\":\"newLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-2\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[#{bold}#Sodelost, Dwarf Rogue#{normal}#\\nCan't believe I agreed to this expedition. I suppose it's because I've known Relle for a while. We've crossed paths many times at Derth's trading post. I even gave her a special rate for my services. Sentimental fool! All it's got me is boots filled with snow and a light coinpurse. I still don't understand why these Kingdom types are so enamoured with drakeskin... makes superior armour they say. Pah! If you can't handle metal armour, what business do you have even wearing armour? Leather has about as much use as a halfling tied to a... noises up ahead, must stop writing.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-3\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[#{bold}#Relle, Cornac Fighter & Expedition Captain#{normal}#\\nSodelost is dead, and so is Gorran. The former by Gorran's hand, the latter by my hand. Even in these wastes I cannot abide such an act of mutiny. I was aware of Gorran's anger ever since the drake attack, but I never dreamed he would turn on Sodelost like he did. He had taken my longsword as I slept the previous night, strode up to Sodelost, unheeding of I and Xann watching him, ran him through and laughed. Simply laughed. There was nothing for it; I wrenched my sword from his hand and brought it down on his neck. The commotion seems to have stirred up a nearby drake's nest, and now I fear we don't have the strength to repel a concentrated attack. We may have to abandon this expedition.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-5\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q003\",\"source\":\"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature!\\nWith it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business.\\nPlease!\",\"target\":\"我可以给你一件斗篷，它能隐藏你的真实本质！\\n穿上它，任何人看到的都只会是一个普通人类，你便可以自由行事。\\n求求你！\",\"source_context\":\"You are strong but you cannot resist them all!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"So what do you propose?\\\", jump=\\\"what\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[kill him]\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc.die = nil\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:doEmote(_t\\\"ARRGGggg... You are alone! You will be destroyed!\\\", 60)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:die(player)\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"what\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thanks for the information. Now you may die. [kill him]\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc.die = nil\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:doEmote(_t\\\"ARRGGggg... You are alone! You will be destroyed!\\\", 60)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:die(player)\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nreturn \\\"welcome\\\"\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q004\",\"source\":\"Tales of the Spellblaze\",\"target\":\"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\",\"source_context\":\"-- This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\\n-- but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\\n-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"SPELLBLAZE_LORE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, obj)\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-1\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-6\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-7\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-8\\\") then return false end\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"source\":\"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\",\"target\":\"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\",\"source_context\":\"-- but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\\n-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Tales of the Spellblaze\\\", id = \\\"SPELLBLAZE_LORE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, obj)\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-1\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-6\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-7\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-8\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\treturn true\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"source\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\",\"target\":\"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\",\"source_context\":\"local Dialog = require \\\"engine.ui.Dialog\\\"\\nlocal Textzone = require \\\"engine.ui.Textzone\\\"\\nlocal FontPackage = require \\\"engine.FontPackage\\\"\\nlocal Quest = require \\\"engine.Quest\\\"\\n\\nmodule(..., package.seeall, class.inherit(Dialog))\\n\\nlocal statuses = {\\n\\t[-1] = _t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#New#LAST# Quest!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.PENDING] = _t\\\"Quest #AQUAMARINE#Updated!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.COMPLETED] = _t\\\"Quest #LIGHT_GREEN#Completed!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.DONE] = _t\\\"Quest #LIGHT_GREEN#Done!\\\",\\n\\t[Quest.FAILED] = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\",\\n}\\n\\nfunction _M:init(quest, status)\\n\\tlocal use_ui = \\\"quest\\\"\\n\\tif quest.use_ui then use_ui = quest.use_ui end\\n\\tif status == Quest.FAILED then use_ui = \\\"quest-fail\\\" end\\n\\t\\n\\tif status == Quest.DONE then\\n\\t\\tif use_ui == \\\"quest-escort\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\tif quest.to_zigur then self.dialog_h_middles_alter = {b8 = \\\"ui/antimagic_complete_dialogframe_8_middle.png\\\"}\\n\\t\\t\\telse self.dialog_h_middles_alter = {b8 = \\\"ui/normal_complete_dialogframe_8_middle.png\\\"} end\\n\\t\\telseif use_ui == \\\"quest-idchallenge\\\" then self.dialog_h_middles_alter = {b8 = \\\"ui/complete_dialogframe_8_middle.png\\\"}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"source\":\"You must wear this object to use it!\",\"target\":\"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\",\"source_context\":\"\\n\\tself.key:addBinds{ EXIT = function() game:unregisterDialog(self) end, }\\nend\\n\\nfunction _M:use(item)\\n\\tif not item then return end\\n\\tgame:unregisterDialog(self)\\n\\n\\tlocal act = item.action\\n\\n\\tif act == \\\"use\\\" then\\n\\t\\tif self.object:wornInven() and not self.object.wielded and not self.object.use_no_wear then\\n\\t\\t\\tself:simplePopup(_t\\\"Impossible\\\", _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\")\\n\\t\\telse\\n\\t\\t\\tself.actor:playerUseItem(self.object, self.item, self.inven, self.onuse)\\n\\t\\t\\tself.onuse(self.inven, self.item, self.object, true)\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\telseif act == \\\"identify\\\" then\\n\\t\\tself.object:identify(true)\\n\\t\\tself.onuse(self.inven, self.item, self.object, false)\\n\\telseif act == \\\"drop\\\" then\\n\\t\\tif self.object:getNumber() > 1 then\\n\\t\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(GetQuantity.new(_t\\\"Drop how many?\\\", (\\\"1 to %d\\\"):tformat(self.object:getNumber()), self.object:getNumber(), self.object:getNumber(), function(qty)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tqty = util.bound(qty, 1, self.object:getNumber())\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tself.actor:doDrop(self.inven, self.item, function() self.onuse(self.inven, self.item, self.object, false) end, qty)\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"source\":\"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\",\"target\":\"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\ts:drawStringBlended(self.font, (player.descriptor and _t\\\"Race : \\\" or _t\\\"Type : \\\")..((player.descriptorDisplayName and _t(player:descriptorDisplayName(\\\"subrace\\\") or \\\"\\\", \\\"birth descriptor name\\\")) or _t(player.type, \\\"entity type\\\"):capitalize()), w, h, 0, 200, 255, true) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tlocal class_evo = \\\"\\\"\\n\\t\\tif player.descriptor and player.descriptor.class_evolution then class_evo = \\\" (\\\"..player.descriptor.class_evolution..\\\")\\\" end\\n\\t\\ts:drawStringBlended(self.font, (player.descriptor and _t\\\"Class: \\\" or _t\\\"Stype: \\\")..((player.descriptorDisplayName and _t(player:descriptorDisplayName(\\\"subclass\\\") or \\\"\\\", \\\"birth descriptor name\\\")) or _t(player.subtype, \\\"entity subtype\\\"):capitalize())..class_evo, w, h, 0, 200, 255, true)\\n\\t\\tif player:attr(\\\"forbid_arcane\\\") then\\n\\t\\t\\tlocal follow = (player.faction == \\\"zigur\\\" or player:attr(\\\"zigur_follower\\\")) and _t\\\"Zigur follower\\\" or _t\\\"Antimagic adherent\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_ANTIMAGIC_USER, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, \\\"#ORCHID#\\\"..follow, w+200, h, 255, 255, 255, true))\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\tif player.randventurer_seed then\\n\\t\\t\\tlocal text = (\\\"- Seed: #LIGHT_STEEL_BLUE#%s\\\"):tformat(player.randventurer_seed)\\n\\t\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\t\\tself:mouseClick(function() core.key.setClipboard(player.randventurer_seed) Dialog:simplePopup(\\\"Wanderer Seed\\\", \\\"Copied to clipboard!\\\") end, _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, text, w, h, 255, 255, 255, true))\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\ts:drawStringBlended(self.font, _t\\\"Size : \\\"..(player:TextSizeCategory():capitalize()), w, h, 0, 200, 255, true) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_LEVEL, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font,  (\\\"Level: #00ff00#%d\\\"):tformat(player.level), w, h, 255, 255, 255, true)) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_LEVEL, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, (\\\"Exp  : #00ff00#%2d%%\\\"):tformat(100 * cur_exp / max_exp), w, h, 255, 255, 255, true)) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\t\\tself:mouseTooltip(self.TOOLTIP_GOLD, s:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, (\\\"Gold : #00ff00#%0.2f\\\"):tformat(player.money), w, h, 255, 255, 255, true)) h = h + self.font_h\\n\\n\\t\\th = h + self.font_h\\n\\n\\t\\ts:drawColorStringBlended(self.font, _t\\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#Resources:\\\", w, h, 255, 255, 255, true) h = h + self.font_h\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"source\":\"Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!\",\"target\":\"我不是来和你们聊天的，我是来阻止你们的！\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tfor uid, e in pairs(game.level.entities) do\\n\\t\\t\\tif e.define_as and (e.define_as == \\\"ELANDAR\\\" or e.define_as == \\\"ARGONIEL\\\") then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\te:setTarget(aeryn)\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\tend\\nend\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*The two Sorcerers stands before you, shining like the Sun.*#WHITE#\\nAh! Our guest is finally here. I take it you found the peak entertaining?]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"explain\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Why are you doing all that? You were supposed to help people!\\\", jump=\\\"explain\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"explain\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[Oh, but all we want is to help people. We have come to the self-evident conclusion that common people are just unfit to govern themselves, always bickering, arguing...\\nSince the last invasion of the orcs there has been no threat to unite them!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"So you have decided to become the threat yourselves?\\\", jump=\\\"explain2\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"source\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#Display mouse gesture trails#WHITE##{normal}#\",\"target\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#隐藏鼠标手势轨迹#WHITE##{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"Always display combat properties of shields even if you don't know shield attack talents.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Always show shield combat properties#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats and _t\\\"enabled\\\" or _t\\\"disabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.tome.display_shield_stats = not config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats\\n\\t\\tgame:saveSettings(\\\"tome.display_shield_stats\\\", (\\\"tome.display_shield_stats = %s\\\\n\\\"):format(tostring(config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats)))\\n\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.hide_gestures and _t\\\"disabled\\\" or _t\\\"enabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\\n\\t\\tgame:saveSettings(\\\"hide_gestures\\\", (\\\"hide_gestures = %s\\\\n\\\"):format(tostring(config.settings.hide_gestures)))\\n\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"If enabled new quests and quests updates will display a big popup, if not a simple line of text will fly on the screen.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Big Quest Popups#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.tome.quest_popup and _t\\\"enabled\\\" or _t\\\"disabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.tome.quest_popup = not config.settings.tome.quest_popup\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"source\":\"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He leans toward you. Your mind is suddenly filled with feelings of peace and happiness.*#WHITE#\\nThis is the Way.\",\"target\":\"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他靠向你，你的脑海里突然充满了平静和幸福。*#WHITE#\\n这不是维网。\",\"source_context\":\"--\\t\\t{_t\\\"So you will wander the land alone?\\\", jump=\\\"done\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"done\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[I am never alone. I have the Way.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Farewell, then.\\\", action=function(npc, player) npc:disappear() end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"way\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thank you for this vision. Farewell, my friend.\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc:disappear()\\n\\t\\t\\tgame:setAllowedBuild(\\\"yeek\\\", true)\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n-----------------------------------------------------------\\n-- Yeek version\\n-----------------------------------------------------------\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"source\":\"Open profile(in browser)\",\"target\":\"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif citem and citem.login then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif data then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal list = {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Show infos\\\", ui=\\\"show\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Whisper\\\", ui=\\\"whisper\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Ignore\\\", ui=\\\"ignore\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", ui=\\\"profile\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Report for bad behavior\\\", ui=\\\"report\\\"}\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif data.char_link then table.insert(list, 3, {name=_t\\\"Open charsheet(in browser)\\\", ui=\\\"charsheet\\\"}) end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDialog:listPopup((\\\"User: \\\"):tformat(citem.login), _t\\\"Action\\\", list, 300, 200, function(sel)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif not sel or not sel.ui then return end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif sel.ui == \\\"show\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal UserInfo = require \\\"engine.dialogs.UserInfo\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(UserInfo.new(data))\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"profile\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tutil.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"charsheet\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tutil.browserOpenUrl(data.char_link, {is_external=true})\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore2.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[In this picture a huge god with glowing eyes towers above the land, and in his right hand he holds high the sun. The other gods are running from him, wincing from the light.\\nThere is some text underneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Fa AMAKTHEL tabak, ik koru bazan tro yu, ik ranaheli tobol don schek ruun. Ik blana dem Soli as banafel ik goriz uf Eyal ik blod, \\\"Tro fasa goru domus asam, ik goru domit tro Eyal.\\\"'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'But AMAKTHEL came, and his might surpassed all else, and the petty gods fled before his glory. And he made the Sun from his breath and held it above the world and said, \\\"All that this light touches shall be mine, and this light shall touch all the world.'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-3\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"third mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore3.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[This picture shows the huge god holding some smaller figures in his hands and pointing out at the lands beyond. You imagine these figures must be the Sher'Tul.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'And AMAKTHEL made the SHER'TUL, and gave unto us the powers to achieve all that we set our will to, and said to us \\\"Go forth to where the light touches and take all for your own.\\\"'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"fourth mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore4.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[You see a mural showing a huge metropolis made of crystal, with small islands of stone floating in the air behind it. In the foreground is sitting a Sher'Tul, with a hand stretched up to the sky.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world, and built for ourselves towering cities of crystal and fortresses that travelled the skies. But some were not content...'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"source\":\"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\",\"target\":\"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\",\"source_context\":\"newAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Bronze Donator\\\", id = \\\"BRONZE_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated up to 5 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Silver Donator\\\", id = \\\"SILVER_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated at least 6 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Gold Donator\\\", id = \\\"GOLD_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Stralite Donator\\\", id = \\\"STRALITE_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated at least 31 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Voratun Donator\\\", id = \\\"VORATUN_DONATOR\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Donated more than 60 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.]],\\n\\tno_difficulty_duplicate = true, no_chat_broadcast = true,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"source\":\"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\",\"target\":\"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 30-wave mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Master of Arena\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 60-wave mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"XXX the Destroyer\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Grand Master\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Earned the rank of Grand Master in the arena.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Ten at one blow\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed 10 or more enemies in one single attack in the arena.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"source\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\",\"target\":\"调试模式 -- 锁定阵营\",\"source_context\":\"-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nrequire \\\"engine.class\\\"\\nlocal Dialog = require \\\"engine.ui.Dialog\\\"\\nlocal List = require \\\"engine.ui.List\\\"\\nlocal Faction = require \\\"engine.Faction\\\"\\nlocal GetQuantity = require \\\"engine.dialogs.GetQuantity\\\"\\n\\nmodule(..., package.seeall, class.inherit(Dialog))\\n\\nfunction _M:init()\\n\\tself:generateList()\\n\\tDialog.init(self, _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", 1, 1)\\n\\n\\tlocal list = List.new{width=400, height=500, list=self.list, fct=function(item) self:use(item) end}\\n\\n\\tself:loadUI{\\n\\t\\t{left=0, top=0, ui=list},\\n\\t}\\n\\tself:setupUI(true, true)\\n\\n\\tself.key:addCommands{ __TEXTINPUT = function(c)\\n\\t\\tfor i = list.sel + 1, #self.list do\\n\\t\\t\\tlocal v = self.list[i]\\n\\t\\t\\tif v.name:sub(1, 1):lower() == c:lower() then list:select(i) return end\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q017\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"你永远无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore3.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[This picture shows the huge god holding some smaller figures in his hands and pointing out at the lands beyond. You imagine these figures must be the Sher'Tul.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'And AMAKTHEL made the SHER'TUL, and gave unto us the powers to achieve all that we set our will to, and said to us \\\"Go forth to where the light touches and take all for your own.\\\"'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"fourth mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore4.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[You see a mural showing a huge metropolis made of crystal, with small islands of stone floating in the air behind it. In the foreground is sitting a Sher'Tul, with a hand stretched up to the sky.\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'We conquered the world, and built for ourselves towering cities of crystal and fortresses that travelled the skies. But some were not content...'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-5\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"fifth mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore5.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[This mural shows nine Sher'Tul standing side by side, each holding aloft a dark weapon. Your eyes are drawn to a runed staff held by the red-robed figure in the centre. It seems familiar somehow...\\nThere is some text beneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Zubadon koref noch hesen, ik dorudon koref noch pasor. Cosief maro dondreth karatu - Ranaduzil - ik jein belsan ovrienis.'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'Of pride we accepted no equals, and of greed we accepted no servitude. We made for ourselves terrible weapons - the Godslayers - and nine were chosen to wield them.'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q018\",\"source\":\"Got a character to level 50.\",\"target\":\"角色达到50级。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tname = \\\"Level 30\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got a character to level 30.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Level 40\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got a character to level 40.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Level 50\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Unstoppable\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Returned from the dead.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Utterly Destroyed\\\", id = \\\"EIDOLON_DEATH\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Died on the Eidolon Plane.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q019\",\"source\":\"Would it be possible for my Transmogrification Chest to automatically extract gems?\",\"target\":\"即使我不会提取宝石，也可以让我的转化之盒自动提取宝石吗？\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t{_t\\\"What are you, and what is this place?\\\", jump=\\\"what\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"what\\\", action=set\\\"what\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Master? I am not your mas...\\\", jump=\\\"master\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"master\\\", action=set\\\"master\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Why do I understand you? The texts are unreadable to me.\\\", jump=\\\"understand\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"understand\\\", action=set\\\"understand\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"What can I do here?\\\", jump=\\\"storage\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"storage\\\", action=set\\\"storage\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"What else can this place do?\\\", jump=\\\"energy\\\", cond=isNotSet\\\"energy\\\", action=set\\\"energy\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Would it be possible to improve my Cloak of Deception so I do not need to wear it to pass as a living being?\\\", jump=\\\"permanent-cloak\\\", \\n\\t\\t\\tcond=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal cloak = player:findInAllInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"CLOAK_DECEPTION\\\")\\n\\t\\t\\t\\treturn not q:isCompleted(\\\"permanent-cloak\\\") and q:isCompleted(\\\"transmo-chest\\\") and cloak\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"You asked me to come, about a farportal?\\\", jump=\\\"farportal\\\", cond=function() return q:isCompleted(\\\"farportal\\\") and not q:isCompleted(\\\"farportal-spawn\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"You asked me to come, about the rod of recall?\\\", jump=\\\"recall\\\", cond=function() return q:isCompleted(\\\"recall\\\") and not q:isCompleted(\\\"recall-done\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"transmo-gems\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return not q:isCompleted(\\\"transmo-chest-extract-gems\\\") and q:isCompleted(\\\"transmo-chest\\\") and player:knowTalent(player.T_EXTRACT_GEMS) end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Are there any training facilities?\\\", jump=\\\"training\\\", cond=function() return not q:isCompleted(\\\"training\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Can you use your magic to alter the appearance of my gear?\\\", jump=\\\"shimmer\\\", cond=function() return not q:isCompleted(\\\"shimmer\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I find your appearance unsettling. Any way you can change it?\\\", jump=\\\"changetile\\\", cond=function() return q:isCompleted(\\\"recall-done\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I have come upon a strange thing indeed. #LIGHT_GREEN#[tell him about Melinda]\\\", jump=\\\"cure-melinda\\\", cond=function() return ql and ql:isStatus(engine.Quest.COMPLETED, \\\"saved-beach\\\") and not ql:isStatus(engine.Quest.FAILED) and not ql:isStatus(engine.Quest.COMPLETED, \\\"can_come_fortress\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[leave]\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"master\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[*#LIGHT_GREEN#The creature glares at you.#WHITE#*\\nYou possess a control rod. You are the master.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q020\",\"source\":\"The Legend of Garkul\",\"target\":\"加库尔的八章传说\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-6\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-7\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"spellblaze-chronicles-8\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\treturn true\\n\\tend\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"GARKUL_LORE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Learned the five chapters of the Legend of Garkul.]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, obj)\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-1\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-2\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-3\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-4\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\tif not game.party:knownLore(\\\"garkul-history-5\\\") then return false end\\n\\t\\treturn true\\n\\tend,\\n\\ton_gain = function()\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984617211},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze each item.\n\nQ001: source \"Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.\" target \"在莎西·凯希成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她。\" \"killed her after letting her grow\" — target says \"杀死她\" after growing. Source implies \"after letting her grow as powerful as possible\" — the translation says \"成长到尽可能强大之后杀死她\". This is essentially same. \"after letting her grow\" vs \"在她成长到...之后\" — the nuance: player lets her grow, then kills. Target is fine. Actually target omits \"letting\" (让) — but semantically equivalent. No finding.\n\nQ002: source mentions Gorran, Cornac Archer; target \"科纳克人弓箭手，高岚\" — Gorran translated as 高岚. Names not verifiable. \"addlepated beardling\" → \"没脑子的毛脸小子\" — beardling refers to a young dwarf, but Gorran is a Cornac... anyway. Source: \"read the sign of the tavern in Last Hope from the tavern in Derth\" — target: \"坐在德斯镇的酒馆里就能看清最后的希望城酒馆的招牌\" — that's fine. \"I'm beginning to think that Sodelost has ulterior motives\" → \"苏达罗斯特另有所图\" — fine. Actually wait, source says \"Sodelost has ulterior motives\" but per context Sodelost is the dwarf rogue narrator of note 2... the speaker here is Gorran complaining about the dwarf (Sodelost, though he calls him a scout). Fine. \"lead us up this forsaken mountain to die just so he could rifle through our pockets\" → \"为了翻我们的口袋，故意把我们领上这座鬼山送死\" — fine. No obvious issue. \"beardling\" → \"毛脸小子\" — beardling means dwarf without beard (young), 毛脸 literally \"hairy face\" — reversed? beardling = a young/small dwarf; \"毛脸\" ok-ish. Not clearly objective defect.\n\nQ003: source \"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature! With it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business. Please!\" target \"我可以给你一件斗篷，它能隐藏你的真实本质！穿上它，任何人看到的都只会是一个普通人类，你便可以自由行事。求求你！\" Seems fine. \"normal average Human\" → \"普通人类\" fine. No finding.\n\nQ004: source \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" target \"魔法大爆炸的七章故事\" — \"seven chapters\" added! Source is just \"Tales of the Spellblaze\" with no chapter count. Context says eight chapters. So \"七章\" is an addition and contradicts context (eight chapters). FINDING: ADDITION, \"七章\", correction \"魔法大爆炸的故事\", evidence: desc \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\"\n\nQ005: source \"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\" target \"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\" — \"阅读\" vs \"Learned\" (习得/学会了). \"阅读了\" — learned vs read; reading is the means but \"learned\" is broader. Hmm. This is a slight shift but arguably ok. The bigger issue: \"Spellblaze Chronicles\" translated as \"有关魔法大爆炸的...文献\" — drops \"Chronicles\" title but acceptable. \"阅读了\" vs \"Learned\" — I'd consider minor. Not objective defect? Learned ≠ read strictly. I'd maybe flag UNCERTAIN. Actually the achievement is about knowing lore; 阅读了 is fine colloquially. I'll leave empty or UNCERTAIN. Given rule 4 UNCERTAIN only when evidence points to problem but real ambiguity. \"Learned\" → \"阅读了\" loses meaning of \"learned/mastered\". I'll call it... probably not a finding. Leave empty.\n\nQ006: \"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\" target \"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\" — \"Quest\" translated as \"主线任务\" (main quest). Source just says \"Quest\". This is a generic quest dialog used for all quests, including non-main quests. Adding \"主线\" changes scope. Context shows generic statuses. FINDING: SCOPE/ADDITION. \"主线任务\" correction \"任务\". Evidence: \"[Quest.FAILED] = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"\" and context shows generic \"Quest #LIGHT_GREEN#Completed!\". FINDING.\n\nQ007: \"You must wear this object to use it!\" target \"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\" — wear → 装备, fine. No finding.\n\nQ008: source \"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\" target \"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\" — \"wanderer seed\" → \"流浪者随机种子\" fine. \"Click to c